meta {
  name: Update User
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "displayName": "Updated Name",
    "isAdmin": false,
    "allowedEnvironments": [
      "DEV",
      "QA",
      "UAT"
    ],
    "unmaskEnvironments": [
      "DEV"
    ],
    "writeEnvironments": [
      "DEV"
    ],
    "approveEnvironments": [
      "QA"
    ],
    "jobEnvironments": []
  }
}

docs {
  Update a user's display name, admin flag, or capability lists.

  Environment names outside this deployment's set (see `GET /api/config` →
  `environments`) are silently dropped from every capability list, unless the
  user already has them (an env whose connection is gone right now). Each list is
  saved as sent, so leaving such an env out revokes it.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}).
  **Admin only.**
}
